Depends: ca-certificates, libc6 (>= 2.31)
Description: DLP firewall for LLM agents
 Blocks secrets and PII from leaving your machine. Local CLI/daemon for
 agent DLP (Mode B) with a reverse/forward proxy for egress traffic, rule
 packs, redaction and reversible vault.